---
import { BookOpen, Leaf, MessageCircle } from "@lucide/astro"
---

<section id="community" class="px-container-x py-section">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-landing">
    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <header class="lg:col-span-6">
        <p class="mb-4 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase">
          The waterline community
        </p><h2
          class="max-w-heading text-balance text-headline-2 leading-tight font-semibold tracking-tight"
        >
          Share the knowledge. Keep the places wild.
        </h2><p class="mt-6 max-w-copy text-lg text-muted">
          Trip notes, technique breakdowns, and thoughtful conversations for
          anglers who care as much about the water as the catch.
        </p>
      </header>
      <dl class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-px bg-border lg:col-span-6">
        <div class="bg-background p-7">
          <dt class="text-sm text-muted">Logbook readers</dt><dd
            class="mt-3 text-figure leading-none font-semibold"
          >
            48K
          </dd><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">
            Monthly readers across field notes and guides.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-background p-7">
          <dt class="text-sm text-muted">Field reports</dt><dd
            class="mt-3 text-figure leading-none font-semibold"
          >
            126
          </dd><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">
            Conditions, decisions, mistakes, and lessons logged.
          </p>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
      <article class="bg-background-alt p-7">
        <Leaf aria-hidden="true" /><p class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold">
          “The weather-first checklist changed how I plan every mountain
          session.”
        </p><p class="mt-5 text-sm text-muted">Community note · planning</p>
      </article>
      <article class="bg-background-alt p-7">
        <BookOpen aria-hidden="true" /><p class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold">
          “Technical without turning the water into a spreadsheet.”
        </p><p class="mt-5 text-sm text-muted">Community note · learning</p>
      </article>
      <article class="bg-background-alt p-7">
        <MessageCircle aria-hidden="true" /><p
          class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold"
        >
          “Calm, honest storytelling—including the blank days.”
        </p><p class="mt-5 text-sm text-muted">
          Community note · field stories
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-8 border-t border-border pt-10 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-muted">
          01 · Learn
        </p><p class="mt-3 font-semibold">
          Monthly technique notes grounded in real conditions.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-muted">
          02 · Contribute
        </p><p class="mt-3 font-semibold">
          Reader observations become better questions for the next report.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-muted">
          03 · Protect
        </p><p class="mt-3 font-semibold">
          Locations stay general; care for habitat stays specific.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
